  Sign in to use A2A as part of your paid plan or connect
  an API key for usage-based billing

> 1. Sign in with ChatGPT
     Usage included with Plus, Pro, Business, and Enterprise plans

  2. Sign in with Device Code
     Sign in from another device with a one-time code

  3. Configure providers
     Set up API keys for providers (OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini, GitHub Copilot)

  4. Sign in with A2A account
     Sign in for shared keys and platform features

  Press Enter to continue
